The 13 STL files are unchanged upstream assets. The assembled URDF prefixes names with arm_, removes ROS 1 transmission tags, makes printed parts white, and represents the zero-inertia gripper TCP as a massless fixed frame. Physical joint axes/limits and link inertias are from upstream. The neutral CAD uses the earlier supplied static pose and convex envelopes for six invalid servo internal solids.
